    <briefdescription>
<para>Intent detection and named entity recognition (frozen Phase 1 + Phase 3). </para>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para>Detects user intent category from transcribed text and extracts relevant named entities for downstream processing.</para>
<para><bold>Confidence Thresholds (Frozen):</bold><itemizedlist>
<listitem><para>min_confidence_threshold: 0.5 (default)</para>
</listitem><listitem><para>entity_confidence_threshold: 0.4 (default)</para>
</listitem></itemizedlist>
</para>
<para><bold>Phase 3 Extensions:</bold><itemizedlist>
<listitem><para>Timeout protection: detections exceeding detection_timeout_ms return safe default</para>
</listitem><listitem><para>Clarification prompts: low-confidence results trigger user feedback loop</para>
</listitem><listitem><para>Timeout tracking: <ref refid="classthemis_1_1voice_1_1_voice_intent_detector_1a83241a1718220403f492bcbeb2fa3d89" kindref="member">isTimeoutDetected()</ref> reports detection delays </para>
</listitem></itemizedlist>
</para>
    </detaileddescription>
